<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Nouvelle séance — Talentos</title>
<style>
  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif}
  .wrap{max-width:600px;margin:40px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
  .header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#06b6d4);padding:40px 32px;text-align:center}
  .header h1{color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800}
  .header p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.95rem}
  .icon-wrap{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:16px}
  .body{padding:32px}
  .body h2{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0f172a}
  .body p{color:#475569;line-height:1.7;font-size:0.95rem;margin:0 0 16px}
  .card{background:#f0f9ff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;border-left:4px solid #0ea5e9;margin:12px 0}
  .card strong{display:block;font-size:0.8rem;color:#0369a1;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .card span{font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;font-size:1rem}
  .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700}
  .badge-online{background:rgba(6,182,212,.1);color:#0e7490}
  .badge-onsite{background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);color:#92400e}
  .btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#06b6d4);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.95rem;margin:8px 0}
  .footer{background:#f8fafc;padding:20px 32px;text-align:center;font-size:0.8rem;color:#94a3b8;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0}
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="icon-wrap">📅</div>
    <h1>Nouvelle séance ajoutée</h1>
    <p>{{ formation.titre }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <h2>Bonjour {{ user.firstname ?? user.email }},</h2>
    <p>Une nouvelle séance vient d'être ajoutée à la formation <strong>{{ formation.titre }}</strong> à laquelle vous êtes inscrit(e).</p>
    <div class="card">
      <strong>Séance</strong>
      <span>{{ seance.titre }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="border-left-color:#8b5cf6;background:#faf5ff">
      <strong>Date & Heure</strong>
      <span>{{ seance.dateDebut|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }} → {{ seance.dateFin|date('H:i') }}</span>
    </div>
    {% if seance.type == 'PRESENTIEL' and seance.adresse %}
    <div class="card" style="border-left-color:#f59e0b;background:#fffbeb">
      <strong>📍 Lieu</strong>
      <span>{{ seance.adresse }}</span>
    </div>
    {% elseif seance.type == 'EN_LIGNE' %}
    <div class="card" style="border-left-color:#06b6d4;background:#f0fdfa">
      <strong>🖥 Mode</strong>
      <span>Séance en ligne</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if seance.description %}
    <p style="background:#f8fafc;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#334155">{{ seance.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px">
      <a href="http://localhost:8000/courses/{{ formation.id }}" class="btn">Voir la formation →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">© 2026 Talentos — Plateforme de formation professionnelle</div>
</div>
</body></html>
